From 272c5cffc1a9617cebdd55d61a5787e439986629 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:57:01 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add RomM Library app (browse and download from a RomM server,
 e.g. over Tailscale)

Native app in the Apps tab on top of JukaMix. Only this app is added; none of the
earlier custom apps are carried over.

- first-run wizard (server URL, user/password or rmm_ API token) with VirtualKeyboard
- connection test with readable diagnostics, Tailscale state hint and MagicDNS fallback
- platforms -> paged game list (letter jump, per-platform and global search) -> download
- download with progress, B to stop, resume (Range), size/space checks, 3 download routes
- multi-file ROMs (ZIP) extracted into the right Roms/ folder; names sanitized for FAT/exFAT
- platform -> Roms/ folder table (data/platform_map.tsv); asks once and remembers the rest
- config in Data/romm/config.json (gitignored); log in System/logs/romm_library.log
- tests/romm_library: mock RomM server + selector/VirtualKeyboard/infoscreen mocks (109 checks)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RhMAqBm84PVkwcVFZvG6f2
